<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean feed mills seek 10,000T cottonseed meal.</title>
<headline>S.Korean feed mills seek 10,000T cottonseed meal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean feed mill companies have invited tenders for 10,000 tonnes of cottonseed meal by 2.00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Friday, traders said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Traders said shipment must be made by a single-deck vessel to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>Details of the tender obtained by trading sources are as</p>
<p>follow:</p>
<p>    POSITION  TONNE   ORGIN	   ARRIVAL</p>
<p>	ONE     5,000   World Wide    January 20</p>
<p>	TWO     5,000   World Wide    February 20</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
